## Author

The author field is also fragmented across groups. `Artist` is the EXIF tag;
`XMP-dc:Creator` is the modern standard.

```sh
# read
exiftool -Artist image.jpg
exiftool -XMP-dc:Creator image.jpg

# write to EXIF
exiftool -Artist="Jane Smith" image.jpg

# write to XMP
exiftool -XMP-dc:Creator="Jane Smith" image.jpg

# write to both
exiftool -Artist="Jane Smith" -XMP-dc:Creator="Jane Smith" image.jpg
```

